      "category_id": 2,
      "content_type": "TEXT",
      "arabic_text": "إِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا",
      "translation_text": "Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease. (Surah Ash-Sharh 94:6)",
      "text_content": "Never lose hope in the mercy and timing of Allah. When difficulties surround you, ease is already written alongside it.",
      "reference_source": "Quran 94:6",
      "language": "en",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "likes_count": 342,
      "comments_count": 28,
      "shares_count": 56,
      "saves_count": 112
    },
    {
      "id": "p2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "user_id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "category_id": 3,
      "content_type": "TEXT",
      "arabic_text": "خَيْرُكُمْ مَنْ تَعَلَّمَ الْقُرْآنَ وَعَلَّمَهُ",
      "translation_text": "The best among you are those who learn the Quran and teach it.",
      "text_content": "A timeless reminder for every seeker of knowledge. Spending time reciting, understanding and teaching the Book of Allah elevates one's rank.",
      "reference_source": "Sahih al-Bukhari 5027",
      "language": "en",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "likes_count": 519,
      "comments_count": 42,
      "shares_count": 89,
      "saves_count": 194
    },
    {
      "id": "p3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
      "user_id": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
      "category_id": 4,
      "content_type": "PHOTO",
      "media_id": "m1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "arabic_text": "اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ عِلْمًا نَافِعًا وَرِزْقًا طَيِّبًا وَعَمَلاً مُتَقَبَّلاً",
      "translation_text": "O Allah, I ask You for beneficial knowledge, good provision, and accepted deeds.",
      "text_content": "Recite this beautiful Dua after Fajr prayer to start your day with barakah.",
      "reference_source": "Sunan Ibn Majah 925",
      "language": "en",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "likes_count": 680,
      "comments_count": 35,
      "shares_count": 140,
      "saves_count": 310
    },
    {
      "id": "p4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
      "user_id": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
      "category_id": 7,
      "content_type": "TEXT",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِنَّكَ لَعَلَىٰ خُلُقٍ عَظِيمٍ",
      "translation_text": "And indeed, you are of a great moral character. (Surah Al-Qalam 68:4)",
      "text_content": "The mercy of the Prophet ﷺ encompassed believers and opponents alike. When people treated him with hostility in Ta'if, he made dua for their guidance.",
      "reference_source": "Seerah Ibn Hisham",
      "language": "en",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "likes_count": 420,
      "comments_count": 19,
      "shares_count": 64,
      "saves_count": 88
    },
    {
      "id": "p5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
      "user_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "category_id": 6,
      "content_type": "PHOTO",
      "media_id": "m5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
      "arabic_text": "سُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ وَبِحَمْدِهِ سُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ الْعَظِيمِ",
      "translation_text": "Glory be to Allah and His is the praise, Glory be to Allah the Greatest.",
      "text_content": "Two phrases that are light on the tongue, heavy on the scales, and beloved to the Most Merciful.",
      "reference_source": "Sahih al-Bukhari 6406",
      "language": "en",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "likes_count": 890,
      "comments_count": 62,
      "shares_count": 210,
      "saves_count": 430
    }
  ],
